	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE:\nV_r : 48V\nV_brmin : 53.3V\nV_c = 77.4V\nThis diode is our best option for 48V, but it won't be enough as TPD4S480 has a 63V maximum input voltage, and LMR16006 65V."
