	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE:\nVBUS blocking fet needs to have Vds ≥ 48V (in case TPD fails) and Vgs ≥ 0.42 x 50.4V = 21.16V.\nSince most FETs in this package have a +- 20V Vgs, zener diodes are used to clamp Vgs to 18V.\n"
